 ("steps", [("Example 1 — Water in a pipe (chord and distance)", "A pipe of diameter 26 cm (r = 13) has a water surface 24 cm wide. Half-width 12, so the distance of the surface from the centre is d = √(13² − 12²) = **5 cm**. If the pipe is less than half full the depth of water is 13 − 5 = **8 cm**; if more than half full it is 13 + 5 = 18 cm.")]),
